Deposit_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when caller deposits valid assets
│  ├── it should transfer assets out of caller
│  ├── it should mint shares to the receiver
│  └── it should emit YoGatewayDeposit
├── when receiver differs from caller
│  └── it should still pull from caller and mint to receiver
├── when assets is zero
│  └── it should revert with Gateway__ZeroAmount
├── when receiver is zero
│  └── it should revert with Gateway__ZeroReceiver
├── when target vault not in registry
│  └── it should revert with Gateway__VaultNotAllowed
└── when sharesOut below minSharesOut
   └── it should revert with Gateway__InsufficientSharesOut
